Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:03.27,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,And so outside of certain areas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.27,0:00:05.81,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,we kicked off the Gin Tama anime series with a one hour special full of non-stop laughs and excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.81,0:00:10.02,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,This time, we'll be taking a trip back to when Gin and I first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.41,0:01:58.59,Main01,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,A samurai's sword is not something that is kept in a sheath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.08,0:02:01.70,Main01,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,It's something that you hold in your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:05.91,Main01,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,These days, samurai aren't needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.47,0:02:11.77,Main01,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,But no matter how much times change, there are things that people mustn't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.56,0:02:15.32,Main01,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,Even if there comes a time when you must give up your sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.32,0:02:18.82,Main01,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,you must never lose the unwavering sword kept in your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.52,0:02:21.78,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.81,0:02:26.10,Main01,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,The cloudless Edo sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.66,0:02:28.94,Main01,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,I wish I could've seen it one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.47,0:02:31.60,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,The land of the samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.21,0:02:35.66,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,There was a time, long ago, when our country was called by that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.46,0:02:40.64,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,Those dream-filled blue skies upon which the samurai once gazed,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:42.18,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,are now filled with ships from strange worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.69,0:02:46.35,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,The towns where the samurai once proudly walked
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.67,0:02:48.95,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,are now filled with swaggering, arrogant aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.47,0:02:51.85,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,This is our world today. This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:53.71,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,...our city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:58.78,Main01,MANAGER,0,0,0,,No, you idiot! That's not the one! It's right there, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:02.25,Main01,MANAGER,0,0,0,,Nowadays even a chimpanzee could do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:05.01,Main01,MANAGER,0,0,0,,You're human. You've been working here for more than a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.01,0:03:06.47,Main01,MANAGER,0,0,0,,Why can't you do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:10.44,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I...I'm sorry. Swordsmanship is the only thing I've ever done...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:12.75,Main01,MANAGER,0,0,0,,Loser! You're still clinging to your sword?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.14,0:03:17.71,Main01,MANAGER,0,0,0,,Samurai and swords are all ancient history now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:21.52,Main01,MANAGER,0,0,0,,How long are you going to act as if you're a samurai?! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.52,0:03:22.52,Main01,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,Oh, come on now...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:24.84,Main01,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,Just leave it at that, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:27.64,Main01,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,Hey, kid, don't you bother with the register.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.64,0:03:28.35,Main01,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,Just get me some milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.35,0:03:30.09,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Oh... All right. Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.67,0:03:33.86,Main01,MANAGER,0,0,0,,Sir, you mustn't go so easy on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:36.53,Main01,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,Nah, just that lately whenever I see a samurai,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.53,0:03:38.18,Main01,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,I feel kind of sorry for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.85,0:03:45.71,Main01,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,When we first came here, the samurai were always spoiling for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:48.67,Main01,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,But, now, it's as if we've lost an irritable friend. It's lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:53.42,Main01,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,So I end up wanting to mess with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.68,0:03:59.21,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,Twenty years ago, aliens called the Amanto suddenly came to Edo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:02.97,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,The rise of the Amanto led to the decline of the samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:02.97,Main01,MANAGER,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Shinpachi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.83,0:04:05.43,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,We were stripped away of our swords and status
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.43,0:04:07.97,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,and we abandoned our honor and everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.39,0:04:10.68,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,No, it wasn't only the samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:13.48,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,It was everyone in this country...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.83,0:04:14.56,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:19.75,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,A samurai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:26.76,Main01,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:30.55,Main01,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,Strapping on a wooden sword in the age of the Sword Ban!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.55,0:04:35.26,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Blah blah blah. Are you in heat or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.89,0:04:40.12,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Look at what happened to my chocolate parfait because of your fussing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:43.38,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,All of it spilled out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.43,0:04:46.48,Main01,AMANTO B,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.48,0:04:48.51,Main01,AMANTO C,0,0,0,,Who do you think we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.51,0:04:52.55,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,My doctor told me my blood sugar level was too high...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.55,0:04:56.71,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,So I just have one parfait a week!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:05.44,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,He was too fierce to be called a samurai,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.44,0:05:07.91,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,but too focused...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:10.61,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,...to be called a thug.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.61,0:05:13.75,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Tell your manager that it tasted great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:28.23,Main01,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,All right, all right, out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.23,0:05:29.59,Main01,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,Oh! There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.99,0:05:32.71,Main01,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,So you're the one who's waving around a wooden sword and causing a riot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:35.30,Main01,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,All right, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:35.64,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hold on... Wait. You're mistaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.03,0:05:38.20,Main01,OOKA,0,0,0,,Hey, Yashichi! Check inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:40.05,Main01,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:43.06,Main01,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,Uh-oh... It's the ambassador from Chatoran.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:45.61,Main01,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,This is an international incident...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.61,0:05:46.90,Main01,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,Do you realize what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:49.75,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I told you, it wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:51.62,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,The man who did it already ran off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.62,0:05:54.09,Main01,OOKA,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, that's what they always say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.09,0:05:56.98,Main01,OOKA,0,0,0,,Next time make your excuses after you hide your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.45,0:05:59.79,Main01,OOKA,0,0,0,,I'm going to file a report. Come with us to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.14,0:06:02.36,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:03.55,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.31,0:06:08.18,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,It just doesn't feel right...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.58,0:06:11.23,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I get all cranky if I don't have some sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:15.65,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,How dare you make me take the blame, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:18.59,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Everything's a mess because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.59,0:06:19.98,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What an honest kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:22.13,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You came to give me back my wooden sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:26.25,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's just something I bought on a school trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.25,0:06:27.28,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:29.97,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I just barely managed to get away from the cops!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.97,0:06:33.99,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I keep telling them they've got it wrong, but they won't listen to a samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.99,0:06:36.91,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,My manager even said that I was the murderer...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:38.50,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You got sacked, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:41.92,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,A clerk who can't use a cash register
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:44.66,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,is about as useless as a mom who can't make fried rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.66,0:06:47.07,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Just what did you say about my mother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.07,0:06:50.18,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You're getting all worked up just because you got fired...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.18,0:06:53.44,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Nowadays, there isn't anyone who will hire a samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.44,0:06:56.93,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to survive from now on?! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.77,0:07:05.19,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Quit your whining, you four-eyed idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.19,0:07:07.44,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Don't think that you're the only one who's got problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:12.44,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,In this world, there are samurai who call cardboard boxes their homes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.44,0:07:14.95,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Can't you be more positive like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.49,0:07:18.38,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Do you even know the meaning of the word "positive"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:19.58,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Oh. Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.05,0:07:24.00,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.91,0:07:26.00,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Why aren't you at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.51,0:07:28.23,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Ack! Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.23,0:07:29.22,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:33.89,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,What are you doing screwing around not working, you little punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:36.73,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Do you know what kind of trouble we're in this month?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.73,0:07:40.35,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Even your pathetic paycheck is crucial!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:42.89,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.89,0:07:45.24,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,This is all his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:47.13,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.13,0:07:51.29,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Sorry, gotta catch a rerun of a soap opera this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:01.79,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:08.68,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,That was my big intro scene, so I got a little excited... I kinda went overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.68,0:08:10.16,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.16,0:08:13.38,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,If "sorry" was enough, we wouldn't have seppuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.89,0:08:17.60,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, our dojo may not be able continue to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:21.10,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,It's been twenty years since national isolation was lifted...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.66,0:08:26.77,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Amanto began to come here from far-off planets and Edo has grown beyond recognition...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.69,0:08:32.35,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,But samurai and swords... Those who once held power
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.35,0:08:33.93,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,are now dying out one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:37.39,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,The same goes for our dojo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.39,0:08:40.28,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Because of the ban on swords, all of our students have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:45.50,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Right now, the two of us take part-time jobs in order to try to keep it going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.83,0:08:50.39,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Even so, we try to protect the dojo that our father left behind for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.39,0:08:52.31,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,We've been trying so hard until now, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:54.41,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Because of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.41,0:08:57.05,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,It's all over, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.05,0:08:59.29,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Calm down, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.76,0:09:02.24,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Was your sister raised by gorillas?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:06.21,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Wait, wait! Calm down...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:09.75,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I can't commit seppuku, but I do clean up my own messes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.75,0:09:11.43,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,What is this? A business card?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:15.39,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Odd Jobs, Gintoki Sakata.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.39,0:09:19.15,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You can't be too picky about jobs these days, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:23.07,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,My business is to do whatever I'm asked to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.59,0:09:25.86,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'm Mr. "Odd Jobs" Gin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:29.18,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,If you've got problems, I'll solve them, no matter what...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.18,0:09:31.31,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,You're the one who's causing us problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.31,0:09:33.01,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Find me a job, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:34.49,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.49,0:09:39.63,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I can't find you a job, but I can teach you a chant so you won't be nervous at interviews...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.63,0:09:40.51,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,No thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.13,0:09:44.36,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:49.27,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It's just impossible to run a sword dojo in this day and age...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.12,0:09:53.28,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Swords won't ever be revived again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:57.07,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We don't have anything to gain by desperately protecting this dojo...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.90,0:09:59.74,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,This isn't about profit or gain...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.31,0:10:06.91,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Does a child really need a reason to protect the things that its parents cherished?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:10.80,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,But, Sis, what did Father ever do for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.48,0:10:16.80,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Today I'm definitely going to make you pay me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.80,0:10:19.06,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.06,0:10:20.51,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Now I'm really getting irritated!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:23.48,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey, are you in debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.07,0:10:28.53,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You're leading pretty dangerous lives, for a couple of kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.53,0:10:31.53,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We didn't do it. It was Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.53,0:10:32.02,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:34.82,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What the hell are you blabbering about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:37.12,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Hurry up and bring me my money, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:40.69,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I gotta get home, my favorite soap opera is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.69,0:10:41.94,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, today is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:42.91,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.87,0:10:46.95,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I've been waiting ever since your pop was still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.95,0:10:48.29,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I'm starting to go bald!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.01,0:10:52.71,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,You promised that you'd sell the dojo if you couldn't pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:55.06,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,You're going to keep that promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.06,0:10:56.61,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Wait a moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.61,0:10:58.68,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Why?! That's good enough, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.68,0:11:01.74,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,You don't need to feel obligated to your stupid father
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:04.33,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,who left you nothing but debt when he died!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:06.10,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Get rid of this dojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.46,0:11:10.30,Main01,SUBORDINATE A,0,0,0,,You little... What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:11.47,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.47,0:11:12.94,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,You fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:15.61,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Do you think that I won't hurt you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:18.36,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,just because you're a woman?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:19.07,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.75,0:11:23.44,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:25.58,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Even though she was raised by gorillas, she's still a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.62,0:11:33.13,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:36.25,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Does this dojo still have students?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.99,0:11:38.88,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Honestly, the lot of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:41.22,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Forget the dojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:46.02,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,But I'm going to make you work to pay off your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:51.83,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I've started a new business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.30,0:11:54.85,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,It's called High-Leg Shabu Shabu Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.85,0:11:56.46,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,H-High Leg?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.01,0:11:58.24,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:00.99,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Because I like girls in high-leg outfits, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:04.76,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Well, simply put, it's a flying nightclub.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.53,0:12:07.99,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Technically, they're prohibited in Edo now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.99,0:12:11.14,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,But if it's in the sky, it'll be out of sight from government officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:12.50,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I can do whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:16.64,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,It'll be shabu shabu time while I get to stare at girls in high-leg outfits!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.64,0:12:20.38,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I'll ensnare my customers with sleaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:26.18,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I've gathered beauties from many worlds, but you'd be more than welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:30.74,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Well, it comes down to either selling this dojo or selling yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.74,0:12:32.33,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Which will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:33.43,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.43,0:12:34.61,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,She'd never do something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:36.35,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,All right. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:40.37,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What a dutiful daughter you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.35,0:12:43.63,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hold on... Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:46.22,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Why would you do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.22,0:12:47.51,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We've done enough, haven't we?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:49.06,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:50.08,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:54.77,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Shin, it's as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.32,0:12:58.67,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Nothing good will come from saving this dojo...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.15,0:13:00.60,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,...only pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.60,0:13:03.34,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,But it's also painful to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:08.73,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,It's painful to keep or to discard something that you can never get back...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:11.42,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,If it's going to be painful either way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.37,0:13:15.44,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,I'd rather suffer trying to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.95,0:13:37.05,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What the hell?! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.60,0:13:38.96,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,My stupid sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:40.96,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,She keeps talking about Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:43.22,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What did baldy ever do for us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.22,0:13:45.38,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,He only played Othello with us once in a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.73,0:13:47.30,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Was your dad bald?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:49.30,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Well, he was mentally bald.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:52.54,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hey, you're still here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:56.07,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,And why are you cooking in my house?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.54,0:14:00.84,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Well, I can't go on without eating something sweet periodically.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:03.15,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Then make something easier!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:10.24,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you go after your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.84,0:14:13.67,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:15.43,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It was her decision to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.47,0:14:19.36,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,She really is my Father's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.80,0:14:20.90,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,She's just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:26.71,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Father was a good-natured person who always talked about duty and compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.71,0:14:30.18,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Because of that, he got taken advantage of and died in debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.57,0:14:33.55,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Why was he so careless?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.09,0:14:37.28,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I don't want to die with only grand principles to my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.97,0:14:40.43,Main01,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,But no matter how much times change,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.43,0:14:42.92,Main01,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,there are things that people mustn't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:48.70,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Does a child really need a reason to protect the things that its parents cherished?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:52.77,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,That kind of thinking only gets in the way nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.77,0:14:55.20,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I plan on living smarter and longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.20,0:14:56.26,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:15:01.71,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,But you don't seem very smart to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:06.81,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Samurai don't need a reason to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:11.44,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,If they have something they have to protect, they should draw their sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.67,0:15:14.18,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Do you love your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.42,0:15:20.92,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,"Watch the beautiful sunset from heaven,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:23.18,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,"first boat leaves this afternoon at four."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.18,0:15:23.98,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:27.14,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,The ship's about to leave! Can't you go any faster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.14,0:15:29.81,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey, safety first. That's my motto...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.26,0:15:31.65,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,It'll also hurt if we crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.65,0:15:33.37,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Now's not the time to be saying that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.37,0:15:35.91,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis is in high-leg shabu shabu danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.91,0:15:39.08,Main01,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,Hey! You, without the helmet, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.65,0:15:41.35,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:44.17,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,We don't need road traffic laws in this day and age.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.17,0:15:47.47,Main01,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,That's true, but it'll hurt if you crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.47,0:15:49.41,Main01,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,I'm just telling you because I'm concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.41,0:15:51.88,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'm all right. I have a hard head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.05,0:15:53.41,Main01,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,Huh?! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:55.45,Main01,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,I'm trying to be considerate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.45,0:15:58.46,Main01,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,It really hurts! It's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.46,0:15:59.56,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:00.70,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'm telling you that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.70,0:16:02.07,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,...it's hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.86,0:16:05.77,Main01,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,I've got a nose bleed! I've got a nose bleed! And at my age!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:09.78,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,The Shabu Shabu Heaven has taken off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.78,0:16:11.99,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?! It's so high up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.13,0:16:14.91,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:17.32,Main01,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,Damn him... Mocking me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:18.41,Main01,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:18.87,Main01,OFFICER B,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:24.99,Main01,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.99,0:16:27.34,Main01,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,Do you think that you can outrun the police?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.09,0:16:35.99,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,I'm Otae. Please treat me gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.99,0:16:38.58,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I told you, that's not how you do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.15,0:16:41.57,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,You're supposed to show more cleavage there! Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:46.55,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,I've never had cleavage before in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.55,0:16:49.88,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. You couldn't show any even if you wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:53.52,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Fine! Next we'll work on your technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.07,0:16:56.57,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,It's time to put on your high-leg outfit and give us some shabu shabu heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:16:59.21,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Hold on... That cut is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:01.83,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,This cut is what we're going for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.93,0:17:05.33,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Put it on already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.45,0:17:10.38,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,If you've lost your nerve now, it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.02,0:17:15.81,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,If you think that I'm going to go easy on you just because we're on prime-time, you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.81,0:17:18.14,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,This is for your dojo. So buck up, little soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:29.79,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.79,0:17:33.36,Main01,GORILLA MAN,0,0,0,,Hold on. What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.36,0:17:38.01,Main01,SUBORDINATE B,0,0,0,,Boss! What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.01,0:17:40.21,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,A car crashed into us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.58,0:17:42.74,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,This is bad. It's a police car!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.74,0:17:44.62,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,The cops are onto us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:48.90,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's just a rental.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:53.38,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hello. Odd Jobs at your service!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:56.50,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis! You haven't put on that high-leg outfit yet, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.50,0:17:57.59,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Shin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.59,0:18:00.44,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.44,0:18:02.49,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We've come to get my sister back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.49,0:18:03.70,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:06.89,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Don't any of you understand that it's too late already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.42,0:18:11.46,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Your dojo won't be any safer after this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.46,0:18:13.27,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I don't care about the dojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.37,0:18:18.38,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I want a dojo where my sister is always smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.38,0:18:20.75,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,If I have to see my sister cry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.03,0:18:22.90,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I don't need the dojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:25.38,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Shin...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.38,0:18:29.33,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Fool! What can just the two of you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:30.57,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:34.54,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey, I'll distract 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:36.82,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Go find an escape pod or something and get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.82,0:18:37.97,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Wh-What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.33,0:18:41.35,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You just think about protecting your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.12,0:18:44.14,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'll protect what I want to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.14,0:18:46.66,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What the hell are you going on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.66,0:18:47.83,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:51.80,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,All right! Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:53.91,Main01,SUBORDINATES,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.91,0:18:54.50,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:55.90,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,H-His style is crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:18:57.53,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,...but strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.90,0:19:00.86,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Shinichi! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.70,0:19:03.24,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It's "Shinpachi," you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:05.77,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.77,0:19:07.29,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Will he be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:10.18,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Why is he doing this for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.18,0:19:11.67,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:13.67,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,But he'll come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.67,0:19:16.42,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Because I sense it in him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:18.14,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,The thing that Father talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:24.38,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,He really came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.38,0:19:27.39,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,That was tough! It was far tougher than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.76,0:19:31.14,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Try a little harder! You didn't even last a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.14,0:19:35.25,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You idiot! It's really tough to make a minute-long anime!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:37.48,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Just find an escape pod right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.37,0:19:41.11,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.79,0:19:42.90,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,The engine room?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:46.80,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,It's a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:49.91,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Let's end this game of tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.82,0:19:52.83,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,How pathetic...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.83,0:19:56.08,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,The samurai who once protected the country with their swords
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.08,0:19:59.48,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,are now good-for-nothings who can't even protect a single girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.49,0:20:03.79,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,There's nothing for you to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.79,0:20:07.43,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,This country... This sky, they all belong to us, the Amanto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.81,0:20:10.27,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,The country? The sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.27,0:20:11.68,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You can have 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.29,0:20:14.98,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'm busy protecting the things in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.79,0:20:19.94,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I don't know how many things I have failed to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:25.40,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I don't have anything left, but at least if I find something falling before me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.49,0:20:27.83,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I want to pick it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.83,0:20:32.46,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What pathetic warrior spirit... I've had enough of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.46,0:20:33.24,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.24,0:20:35.66,Main01,STAFF A,0,0,0,,Hold on... Sir, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.66,0:20:38.24,Main01,STAFF A,0,0,0,,What'll happen if we hit the you-know-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.24,0:20:39.81,Main01,STAFF A,0,0,0,,We'll die along with the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.81,0:20:41.88,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,O-Oh no, I forgot...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.60,0:20:45.05,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Hey, he's climbing it! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:47.05,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.05,0:20:49.39,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,That's not good! That's the ship's engine core.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.72,0:20:53.87,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What's precious to my client is precious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.28,0:20:55.97,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,In order to protect them...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.97,0:20:57.18,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'll do...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:20:59.93,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,...anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:06.80,Main01,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,No! He really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:17.58,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What is this floating sensation? I feel sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.58,0:21:19.52,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Is this thing falling?! Are we falling?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.89,0:21:32.97,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Luckily we were over the ocean, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.79,0:21:36.65,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,...who knows what would have happened if we had fallen on the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:39.69,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a crazy samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.41,0:21:41.61,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.46,0:21:44.11,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,In the end, he saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.69,0:21:47.14,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.09,0:21:52.09,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I aided in the arrest of ruffians who were disturbing the peace in Edo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.09,0:21:54.78,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You can let the fact that I borrowed a police car slide!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.78,0:21:57.84,Main01,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,"Borrowed"? My car and I are a complete wreck!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.84,0:22:00.27,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You've always been a wreck! You actually look even better like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.27,0:22:01.67,Main01,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,Seriously?! What part?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.46,0:22:04.48,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:05.33,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.75,0:22:09.68,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,You found something in him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.16,0:22:13.39,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,Go and find your sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.05,0:22:16.12,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,I'll look for it my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.58,0:22:18.66,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,It's all right. I won't do anything rash anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.29,0:22:22.94,Main01,OTAE,0,0,0,,I don't want to see you cry either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.89,0:22:24.99,Main01,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.87,0:22:28.69,Main01,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,Even if there comes a time when you must give up your sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.69,0:22:32.23,Main01,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,you must never lose the unwavering sword kept in your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.14,0:22:36.07,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.84,0:22:41.17,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,What sort of soul does this guy have? It's very difficult to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.79,0:22:45.23,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,I think it's dim but it's definitely shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.52,0:22:51.35,Main01,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,Right now, I think I'd like to watch it shine for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.39,0:24:30.65,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Oh no! I forgot that Jump goes on sale today!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.65,0:24:32.51,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Should I use this opportunity to grow out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.51,0:24:35.06,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,No! Men are boys at heart until they die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.06,0:24:35.75,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,The next episode:
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.75,0:24:39.95,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,"Watch Out! Weekly Shonen JUMP Sometimes Comes Out on Saturdays!"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.39,0:24:54.67,Main01,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I wish I could shoot something like Getsuga Tensho, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.15,0:01:45.04,On Screen,CAPTION,0,0,0,,[Sorry, we got carried away a little during last week's special.]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:50.14,On Screen,CAPTION,0,0,0,,[This episode, we're starting from when Gin and Shinpachi first meet.]
